				"synopsis": {
					"type": "LSString",
					"value": "In-party / camp dialog of the RJTP companion. One greeting root, then a topical greeting (vanilla TG Object flags, cleared on play) or the default greeting. Let's talk (eleven topics, proposal 5.1 and 5.10), join (vanilla OriginAddToParty), join with a full party (nests vanilla GLO_CompanionSwap_Camp), wait at camp (OriginRemoveFromPartyAfterDialog), leave for good (RJTP_Event_Dismiss). v0.3a: the timeline is an unmodified copy of vanilla CAMP_Volo's; NPC node UUIDs and SpeakerMappingIds are the donor's (tools/gen_timelines.py)."
				}
			}
